    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "FAQ SIMILARITY MATCHING\n\n• Uses a generic Levenshtein Distance algorithm\n• Compares the user's message with all FAQ questions\n• Selects the FAQ with the highest similarity score\n• No question-specific hardcoded if/else logic\n• Similarity threshold: 0.60\n\nThreshold Trade-off:\n0.60 provides typo tolerance while reducing false matches.\nHigher thresholds may reject valid misspelled questions.\nLower thresholds may return unrelated FAQ answers.",
        "height": 304,
        "width": 496,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        288,
        160
      ],
      "id": "6e389bc9-e4c3-4a72-91aa-6a16143a1ce7",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "SAFE FALLBACK & LOGGING\n\nIf the best similarity score is below 0.60:\n\n• The bot does NOT guess an answer\n• The unanswered question is logged to Google Sheets\n• The user receives an escalation message\n• Logged questions can later be reviewed and added to the FAQ knowledge base",
        "height": 256,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1024,
        272
      ],
      "id": "c56e7f72-e07d-4c8e-900c-37127957441d",
      "name": "Sticky Note2"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "LIVE FAQ MANAGEMENT — BONUS\n\nAdmin command:\n/addfaq Question | Answer\n\n• Admin identity is verified before adding data\n• The command is parsed generically\n• New question/answer pairs are appended to Google Sheets\n• No workflow code changes are required\n• Newly added FAQs become immediately available for matching",
        "height": 256,
        "width": 544,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        448,
        -576
      ],
      "id": "b4f3e8f4-51e2-406d-9862-e06e8a0c2997",
      "name": "Sticky Note3"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "FOLLOW-UP CONFIRMATION — BONUS\n\nAfter a successful FAQ match:\n\n• The bot asks: “Did that answer your question?”\n• /yes → Sends a positive confirmation\n• /no → Acknowledges that the answer was not helpful\n• Confirmation commands are routed separately from FAQ matching",
        "height": 208,
        "width": 576,
        "color": 7
      },
